BM ON — Best Movies

BM ON is an Android-first entertainment discovery app in development.

Planned Features

- Movie catalogue and search
- Movie posters, descriptions, genres and release years
- Official movie trailers
- Watchlist and favourites
- Live football fixtures and match information
- Links to authorised content providers
- Premium black-and-gold interface

Technology

- React Native
- Expo
- TypeScript
- Supabase
- PostgreSQL

Content Rights

BM ON intends to use authorised content providers only. It will not host or distribute movies without permission.

TMDB Attribution

This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
